# Environment varijable — Website / Netlify Functions

Kopiraj ovaj fajl u `.env` i popuni vrednostima iz Netlify Environment Variables panela.

```
# Netlify > Site Settings > Environment Variables
GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
GA_API_SECRET=your_api_secret_here
```

## Gde pronaci vrednosti

- **GA_MEASUREMENT_ID** — Google Analytics 4 Admin > Data Streams > tvoj stream > Measurement ID
- **GA_API_SECRET** — Google Analytics 4 Admin > Data Streams > tvoj stream > Measurement Protocol API secrets

## Napomena

Ove varijable se koriste ISKLJUCIVO server-side u Netlify funkcijama (`netlify/functions/`).
Nikad ih ne stavljaj u client-side JavaScript fajlove.

Netlify Functions koje koriste ove varijable:
- `netlify/functions/track.js` — GA4 Measurement Protocol proxy
- `netlify/functions/health.js` — health check (proverava da li su varijable postavljene)
